From 603d0f81b52228d20deb94419b854e5532e46e07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Spitzauer <LucaSpitzauerTUM@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:27:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add transformer CARL architecture selectable via
 model.architecture

model.architecture: dnn (default) | transformer. The transformer is a small
feature-tokenising encoder (one token per feature + [CLS]); hyperparameters
under model.transformer. Works for single-network, process-pool, vectorized
(torch.func.vmap) and k-fold ensembles and for EnsembleScorer inference.
Checkpoints store the architecture; older checkpoints load as dnn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
